well tonight a north las vegas woman's  desperate plea for you to consider  getting the copic vaccine as she just  lost her daughter to the virus and now  her son is fighting for his life  victoria saha tells us how painful it  was for this woman to watch the virus  just tear up her family this is the  story  mom it hurts it hurts i can't breathe  jamie patrick recalls one of the last  conversations she had with her daughter  brandi less than a month ago she just  said mom i just want you to know if i  don't make it through this i love you  patrick tells me her daughter didn't get  the vaccine because she was afraid of  the side effects however once diagnosed  with covet in july her condition quickly  deteriorated she was  so bad they put her in icu right away  texts sent to her mom from the hospital  say i can't breathe patrick says doctors  did everything they could but as brandy  was being intubated she went into  cardiac arrest they do cpr they break  bones and you can hear them crushing in  their chest you know and  and they worked hard in the midst of all  of this her son dustin also not  vaccinated was admitted to the hospital  with covid and is now in the icu i miss  her so much  i haven't even had a chance to grieve  her because i'm so worried about dustin  he's he's minute by minute critical  patrick says she did get vaccinated and  firmly believes it saved her life and  now her son has second thoughts he says  wait till i get out i'm going to tell  all my friends go get the shot go get  the shot don't be fooling around as  dustin fights to live patrick is doing  what she can to be nearby usually  between midnight and 6 a.m i'm sleeping  in the parking lot just  hoping i don't get that call because i  don't want to get that call and leave  some text messages even though he can't  see them right now when he gets out  he'll have a book to read  victoria saha 8 news now  patrick says she doesn't want another  family to go through the same heartache  which is why she hopes this story will  help push more people to get vaccinated  doctors say if her son dustin does pull  through there's a good chance he could  have to get a lung transplant the family  has set up a gofundme page to help with  medical bills and that link is on our  website
 

